{"q":"509","t":"Fibonacci Number","d":"Easy","p":false,"c":"<p>The <b>Fibonacci numbers</b>, commonly denoted <code>F(n)</code> form a sequence, called the <b>Fibonacci sequence</b>, such that each number is the sum of the two preceding ones, starting from <code>0</code> and <code>1</code>. That is,</p>\n\n<pre>\nF(0) = 0, F(1) = 1\nF(n) = F(n - 1) + F(n - 2), for n &gt; 1.\n</pre>\n\n<p>Given <code>n</code>, calculate <code>F(n)</code>.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> n = 2\n<strong>Output:</strong> 1\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> F(2) = F(1) + F(0) = 1 + 0 = 1.\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> n = 3\n<strong>Output:</strong> 2\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> F(3) = F(2) + F(1) = 1 + 1 = 2.\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 3:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> n = 4\n<strong>Output:</strong> 3\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> F(4) = F(3) + F(2) = 2 + 1 = 3.\n</pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>0 &lt;= n &lt;= 30</code></li>\n</ul>\n","h":[],"m":"{\n  \"name\": \"fib\",\n  \"params\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"n\",\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"return\": {\n    \"type\": \"integer\"\n  }\n}","g":[{"name":"Math","slug":"math"},{"name":"Dynamic Programming","slug":"dynamic-programming"},{"name":"Recursion","slug":"recursion"},{"name":"Memoization","slug":"memoization"}],"s":[{"t":"Climbing Stairs","s":"climbing-stairs","d":"Easy","p":false},{"t":"Split Array into Fibonacci Sequence","s":"split-array-into-fibonacci-sequence","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Length of Longest Fibonacci Subsequence","s":"length-of-longest-fibonacci-subsequence","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"N-th Tribonacci Number","s":"n-th-tribonacci-number","d":"Easy","p":false}],"co":[["Google","google"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["tcs","tcs"],["Amazon","amazon"],["Meta","facebook"],["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["Cognizant","cognizant"],["Spotify","spotify"],["Apple","apple"],["Nvidia","nvidia"],["Accenture","accenture"],["Infosys","infosys"],["Morgan Stanley","morgan-stanley"],["Wix","wix"]]}